ender","hash_xxh64":"0x1FA1ED03F4068283","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"아이들이라는 단어를 듣기만 해도 머리가 아파. 왕성 동쪽이라는데... 그대가 무슨 일인지 좀 봐주겠나?","female":"아이들이라는 단어를 듣기만 해도 머리가 아파. 왕성 동쪽이라는데... 그대가 무슨 일인지 좀 봐주겠나?","variant_male_record_index":"171912","variant_female_record_index":"171913","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:沙利叶":{"text":"사리에","source":"沙利叶","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14234370.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234370","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234370","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1423437001:0":{"text":"저 아이일까요? 많이 슬픈가 봐요. 엄청 크게 울고 있어요...","source_cn":"是那个小女孩吗？她哭得好大声，好伤心……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE85183AFC22E853E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14234390.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234390","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234390","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1423439001:1":{"text":"꼬마 아가씨! 저희가 도와줄게요. 무슨 일인가요?","source_cn":"小姑娘，我们有什么能帮到你的地方吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D06636FBDDD9334","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423439002:1":{"text":"모모가 없어졌어요... 모모가 없어졌다고요!","source_cn":"我的咪咪不见了……咪咪找不到了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA6FB4FBA5B37D55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423439003:1":{"text":"모모가 엄마 아빠 대신 제 곁에 있어 줄 거라고 생각했는데... 모모, 너마저 날 버리는 거야...?","source_cn":"我以为咪咪会代替爸爸妈妈陪着我的，咪咪，连你也不要我了吗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85DEC0184F3255E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423439004:1":{"text":"아무래도 이 아이는 가족을 잃고 지금까지 \"모모\"라는 애완동물과 함께 지낸 모양이네요.","source_cn":"听上去这个小女孩失去了自己的家人，和一只叫“咪咪”的宠...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19480A298D8223D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423439005:1":{"text":"꼬마 아가씨, 그 모모는 어떻게 생겼어요?","source_cn":"小姑娘，你的咪咪长什么样子呀？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8312852939DF56BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423439006:1":{"text":"검정색에 귀가 뾰족해요...","source_cn":"黑色的、耳朵尖尖的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDCB5A33BE793D4E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423439007:1":{"text":"아, 켓시군요! 얼른 찾아봐요!","source_cn":"原来是小法妖呀！我们帮她找找吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB148D3B8A76556C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:哭泣的平民女孩":{"text":"울고 있는 평민 소녀","source":"哭泣的平民女孩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14234400.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234400","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234400","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1423440001:1":{"text":"흑흑... 모모가 돌아왔어요! 찾아주셔서 고맙습니다.","source_cn":"呜呜……咪咪回来了！谢谢你们找到它！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDAD528D2DC8EDF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423440002:1":{"text":"잠깐! 네가 말한 그 \"모모\"는 이 몸이 잃은 애완동물이었거늘! 어디서 얻은 것이냐?","source_cn":"站住！汝口中所谓“咪咪”，乃吾遗失之家宠！汝从何处得来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB81AD1DFA8952BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423440003:1":{"text":"저게 무슨 말이에요...?","source_cn":"他说的话是什么意思……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3569B133AE3B7AB7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423440004:1":{"text":"모모를 자기가 잃어버린 애완동물이라면서 어디서 데려왔냐고 하는데...","source_cn":"他说咪咪是他丢失的宠物，问你从哪里得到的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68DCD9517FF42D02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423440005:1":{"text":"흑... 모모는 제가 풀숲에서 주운 아이예요. 그땐 너무 말라서 제가 열심히 돌봤는데...","source_cn":"呜……咪咪是我在草丛里捡到的，那个时候它很瘦，我把它照...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01EB28A4DABF34C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423440006:1":{"text":"헛소리! 이 몸의 애완동물로 호강하면서 지냈거늘! 네가 일부러 훔쳐간 것이지? 근위병, 가서 이 몸의... 아니, 애완동물을 찾아오너라!","source_cn":"满口胡言！吾之家宠养尊处优，定是你蓄意拐跑！侍卫，替吾...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4629DC775DA3FF9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:哭泣的平民女孩":{"text":"울고 있는 평민 소녀","source":"哭泣的平民女孩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:骄傲的贵族男孩":{"text":"오만한 귀족 소년","source":"骄傲的贵族男孩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":3}},"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14234410.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234410","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234410","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1423441001:1":{"text":"아니... 이 쓸모 없는 근위병 같으니! 그만 괴롭혀. 내가 잘못했어!","source_cn":"哇……你们这些侍卫太、太没用了！别打我，我认错还不行嘛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F359D012EF3951E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423441002:1":{"text":"이젠 귀족 행세도 안 하네요.","source_cn":"现在倒是不摆那副贵族的架子了呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F6E03954D9EF98E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1423441002":{"text":"이젠 귀족 행세도 안 하네요.","source_cn":"现在倒是不摆那副贵族的架子了呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F6E03954D9EF98E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423441003:1":{"text":"아, 알았어... 내가 잘못했다고...","source_cn":"我、我知道啦……我错了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D2D5E04345C9815","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423441004:1":{"text":"사실 가문 어른들이 켓시를 버렸다는 거 나도 알고 있었어...","source_cn":"好吧，其实我知道，小法妖是被家里的大人扔掉的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC27ABC7B934505B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423441005:1":{"text":"네가 잘 돌봐준 것 같으니까, 새로운 주인이 되어줘...","source_cn":"既然你把它照顾得这么好，就让你做它的新主人吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEED7ADA25BD1342B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1423441006:1":{"text":"모모, 내가 네 주인이야...","source_cn":"咪咪，我是你的主人了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x452C47E468802B67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","docum