!","source_cn":"总之，事情解决了，我们回去告诉沙利叶吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FD26C42E8075786","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14234430.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234430","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234430","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1423443001:1":{"text":"얼굴에 \"완벽하게 해결\"했다고 써있군. 맞나?","source_cn":"从你们的脸上，我看到了“圆满解决”四个字，我猜的对吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A9EE8DB9E3B0A9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1423443001":{"text":"얼굴에 \"완벽하게 해결\"했다고 써있군. 맞나?","source_cn":"从你们的脸上，我看到了“圆满解决”四个字，我猜的对吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A9EE8DB9E3B0A9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423443002:1":{"text":"지금도 사병을 부리면서 폭력을 쓰는 귀족이 있다니. 아무래도 해야 할 일이 아직 많이 남은 모양이야...","source_cn":"原来现在还有私兵在受贵族的雇佣，肆意使用暴力……看来还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8E3F224BD7A7A6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423443003:1":{"text":"어쨌든, 이번 일도 고마워.","source_cn":"不管怎么说，这次多谢了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1741367D318587EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:0:1":{"text":"(사리에에게 이번 일을 알려준다)","source_cn":"（向沙利叶讲述这次见闻）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x891EB98E323A4D9B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"(사리에에게 이번 일을 알려준다)","female":"(사리에에게 이번 일을 알려준다)","variant_male_record_index":"74428","variant_female_record_index":"74429","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:沙利叶":{"text":"사리에","source":"沙利叶","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":6,"localized_text_count":5,"speaker_count":1}}}}